    "description": "OBSERVED FEATURES & INVENTORY\nMineral Hardness Kit:\nEducational mineral specimen collection designed for studying mineral hardness.\nGeoscience Industries Materials:\nInstruction sheet marked \"Geoscience Industries Ft. Collins, CO.\"\nHardness Reference Guide:\nIncluded printed sheet titled \"Hardness: A Property of Minerals.\"\nNine Specimen Tray:\nWhite compartmented tray containing nine mineral specimens.\nNumbered Samples:\nSeveral specimens retain numbered identification stickers.\nCompartmented Display Insert:\nMolded white insert with individual specimen compartments.\nPresentation Storage Box:\nBrown hinged storage/presentation box included.\nVaried Mineral Types:\nCollection contains specimens of varying colors, translucency, textures, and crystal structures.\nInstruction Sheet Content:\nReference sheet lists minerals associated with the Mohs hardness scale, including talc, gypsum, calcite, fluorite, apatite, feldspar, quartz, beryl-topaz, corundum, and diamond.\nSchool Markings:\n\"B.L. Garza Middle School\" text visible on the instruction sheet and inside the box lid.\nDimensions:\nApproximately 7.25\" x 5\" x 1.5\".\nWeight:\nApproximately 0.61 lbs.\nPERCEIVED FLAWS & CONDITION NOTES\nUsed Educational Set:\nEvidence of prior classroom, educational, or collection use.\nPaper Wear:\nInstruction sheet shows curling, creasing, wrinkles, and handling wear.\nBox Wear:\nStorage box exhibits edge wear, scuffs, surface marks, and age-related wear.\nTray Dust:\nMinor dust, sediment, and mineral residue visible within some compartments.\nLabel Wear:\nNumber stickers show minor wear and aging.\nSchool Ownership Markings:\nSchool identification markings are present on included materials and box interior.\nSpecimen Identification Unverified:\nIndividual mineral identifications have not been independently verified beyond the included educational guide and numbering system.\nNatural Mineral Imperfections:\nSpecimens display natural fractures, inclusions, uneven surfaces, and color variations consistent with mineral samples.\nCompleteness Not Guaranteed:\nNine specimens are present as photographed, but original factory completeness cannot be confirmed.\nStorage Wear:\nMinor rubbing and handling marks visible on specimens and container components.\nUsed AS-IS:\nItem is offered in used condition as pictured. Only the mineral specimens, tray, box, and instruction sheet shown in the photographs are included.",
